  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <div id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Reset count\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #2b2b3c;\n  --card-bg: #3c3c5a;\n  --text: #e0e0ff;\n  --accent: #7a7aff;\n  --accent-hover: #9a9aff;\n  --accent-pressed: #5a5ad0;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--accent-pressed);\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #fff;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  background: var(--accent-pressed);\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--accent-pressed);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count is 0.\n- Buttons: **Increase** (+1), **Decrease** (−1), **Reset** (to 0).\n- Supports negative numbers.\n- Output element with ID `count` displays the current integer.\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with ARIA labels.\n- Responsive layout works down to 360px wide.\n- No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons to change the count.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – logic\n\nTotal source under 200 lines.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
